{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"模态"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"模态"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在形式逻辑中, 模态体现为"},{"Local":{"url":"模态算子","text":"模态算子"}},{"Plain":", 将命题/类型对应到新的命题/类型.</p>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}},{"Plain":"中, 模态通常定义为"},{"Local":{"url":"幂等单子","text":"幂等单子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>零调</h3>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"中, 若对象 $X$ 满足 $* \\sqcup_X * = *$, 则称其为"},{"Local":{"url":"零调对象","text":"零调对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}